### Database
Manages low-level database connections, engine initialization, session generators, and base ORM classes.
Remember to use VALID HTTP ERROR CODES!

## Expected Files
``sessions.py`` - SQLAlchemy engine Creation, SessionLocal, and GetDatabase dependency
``base.py``     - Imports the declarative Base class so migrations and models can inherit from it

